pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: page-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 25, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: |
        <p>PROJEKT ÁTTEKINTÉS</p>
      wrap: false

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 50, 700, 55]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 40
      text: |
        <p>Mi a BETVISION?</p>
      wrap: false

  - elementId: title-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 120, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 3, color: "$primary"}

  - elementId: card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 140, 360, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$surface"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: card1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [85, 165, 40, 40]
    iconName: "fas:brain"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"

  - elementId: card1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [85, 220, 310, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>AI Predikció</p>

  - elementId: card1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [85, 260, 310, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.5
      color: "#BBBBBB"
      text: |
        <p>Mesterséges intelligencia alapú tippajánlások 200+ változó elemzésével: forma, sérülések, időjárás, motiváció, történelmi adatok.</p>

  - elementId: card1-stat
    elementType: text
    bounds: [85, 395, 200, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>68% sikerességi arány</p>

  - elementId: card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [450, 140, 360, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$surface"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: card2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [475, 165, 40, 40]
    iconName: "fas:bolt"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: card2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [475, 220, 310, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Élő Odds</p>

  - elementId: card2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [475, 260, 310, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.5
      color: "#BBBBBB"
      text: |
        <p>Valós idejű odds adatok a legnagyobb bajnokságokból. WebSocket szimuláció élő frissítésekkel és flash animációval.</p>

  - elementId: card2-stat
    elementType: text
    bounds: [475, 395, 200, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>24/7 adatfrissítés</p>

  - elementId: card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 140, 380, 290]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$surface"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: card3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [865, 165, 40, 40]
    iconName: "fas:users"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$gold"

  - elementId: card3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [865, 220, 330, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Közösség & Eszközök</p>

  - elementId: card3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [865, 260, 330, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      lineHeight: 1.5
      color: "#BBBBBB"
      text: |
        <p>Tipster ranglista, bankroll menedzsment, Kelly-kritérium kalkulátor, és szelvény szimulátor egy platformon.</p>

  - elementId: card3-stat
    elementType: text
    bounds: [865, 395, 200, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>15,000+ regisztrált tag</p>

  - elementId: kpi-divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 470, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: kpi1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 500, 360, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$surface"

  - elementId: kpi1-accent
